:: Deadwood Kylar School Widgets [widget]
<!-- 只追加到原版闲聊菜单。课间位置、排练和离校时间沿用 getKylarLocation，不另建日程。 -->
<<widget 'deadwood-kylar-school-ready'>><<silently>>
  <<set _kylarSchoolReady to !!maplebirch.get('Kylar') and C.npc.Kylar.init is 1
    and C.npc.Kylar.state is 'active' and Time.schoolDay and $location is 'school'
    and ((Time.hour is 12 and Time.minute lt (_args[0] ? 60 : 50)) or (Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour * 60 + Time.minute lt 17 * 60 - (_args[0] ? 0 : 10)))
    and ['rear_courtyard', 'library'].includes(getKylarLocation().area) and $exposed lte 0
    and !$daily.kylar.study and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$combat
    and !$statFreeze and !$replayScene and !$frozenValues and !$eventforced>>
<</silently>><</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-kylar-school-link'>>
  <<deadwood-kylar-school-ready>>
  <<set $_menu to document.querySelector('#passage-content a[data-passage="Kylar Chat"]')>>
  <<if _kylarSchoolReady and $_menu>>
    <<schoolicon 'library'>><<lanLink ['Look through your schoolbooks with Kylar', '和凯拉尔一起翻翻课本'] 'Deadwood Kylar School'>><</lanLink>><br><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-kylar-school-study'>><<silently>>
  <<set $_choice to _args[0]>><<set $_area to getKylarLocation().area>>
  <<deadwood-kylar-school-ready>>
  <<if _kylarSchoolReady and ['notes', 'words'].includes($_choice)>>
    <<pass 10>><<schooleffects>>
    <<deadwood-kylar-school-ready true>>
    <<if _kylarSchoolReady and getKylarLocation().area is $_area>>
      <<set $daily.kylar.study to $_choice>><<npcincr Kylar love 1>>
      <<if $_choice is 'notes'>><<englishskill 2>><<else>><<stress -2>><</if>>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</silently>><</widget>>

:: Deadwood Kylar School
<<set $location to 'school'>><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck or $combat>><<exit>><</if>>
<<set _area to getKylarLocation().area>>
<<set $outside to _area is 'rear_courtyard' ? 1 : 0>>
<<set $bus to _area is 'library' ? 'schoollibrary' : 'school'>>
<<deadwood-kylar-school-ready>>
<<if $daily.kylar.study and C.npc.Kylar.init is 1 and C.npc.Kylar.state is 'active'>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if $daily.kylar.study is 'notes'>>
        You compare the notes you took in English.
        <<if C.npc.Kylar.love gte 50>>
          Kylar turns the page whenever you reach the bottom, then hastily turns it back when you point to a line you haven't finished.
          "Sorry. I thought—" <<He>> stops and lets you read.
        <<else>>
          Kylar slides <<his>> book towards you without a word. When you ask about a passage, <<he>> points to the next page, still looking down at <<his>> notes.
        <</if>><br><br>
        You find something one of you missed, and spend a while putting it right. When you close your book, Kylar carefully copies your correction into <<his>> own.
      <<else>>
        You pick a long word from the page and see how many shorter words you can make from its letters.
        Kylar writes <<his>> answers behind a cupped hand. "No looking."<br><br>
        <<He>> catches you counting <<his>> list and pulls it closer.
        <<if C.npc.Kylar.love gte 50>>
          There are several words crossed out, and your name, circled twice, in the margin.
          "That one doesn't count," <<he>> mumbles, covering it with <<his>> sleeve.
        <<else>>
          You point to a word with too many letters. <<He>> counts them again, then crosses it out without looking at you.
        <</if>>
      <</if>>
      <<if isLoveInterest('Kylar')>><br><br>When you reach for your pencil, <<his>> hand closes over yours. <<He>> holds on until you look at <<him>>.<</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if $daily.kylar.study is 'notes'>>
        你们对照起语文课的笔记。
        <<if C.npc.Kylar.love gte 50>>
          你读到页尾时，凯拉尔便替你翻页，见你指向还没读完的一行，<<he>>又慌忙翻了回来。
          “对不起。我以为……”<<He>>停住了，等你看完。
        <<else>>
          凯拉尔一声不响地把课本推向你。你问起其中一段，<<he>>指了指下一页，目光仍落在自己的笔记上。
        <</if>><br><br>
        你们找出几处遗漏，花了些时间补全。你合上课本时，凯拉尔还在认真地把你改过的地方抄进<<his>>自己的笔记。
      <<else>>
        你从课文里挑了一个长单词，和凯拉尔比赛，看谁能用其中的字母拼出更多短词。
        凯拉尔用手遮住答案。“不、不许偷看。”<br><br>
        <<He>>发现你在数<<his>>列了多少词，便把本子往回拉。
        <<if C.npc.Kylar.love gte 50>>
          几处答案被划去了，页边却写着你的名字，还圈了两遍。
          “这个不算。”<<he>>嘟囔着，用袖口盖住了它。
        <<else>>
          你指出一个多用了字母的词。<<He>>重新数了数，低头把它划掉了。
        <</if>>
      <</if>>
      <<if isLoveInterest('Kylar')>><br><br>你伸手去拿铅笔时，<<his>>手覆了上来。直到你转头看<<him>>，<<he>>也没松开。<</if>>
  <</language>><<glove>><<if $daily.kylar.study is 'notes'>><<genglish>><<else>><<lstress>><</if>>
<<elseif _kylarSchoolReady>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You sit beside Kylar and take out your schoolbook.
      <<if C.npc.Kylar.love gte 50>><<He>> moves <<his>> things aside so quickly that a pencil rolls off the edge.<<else>><<He>> looks at your book, then shifts <<his>> things a little.<</if>>
      <<if $KylarExpansion.notes_repaired>>
        The page you copied is tucked inside <<his>> book.
        <<if $KylarExpansion.notes_day lt Time.days>>
          "Nobody wrote on this one," <<he>> whispers, smoothing it down.
          <<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>>"I didn't let them near it." <<He>> keeps a finger on its edge as you turn the page.<</if>>
        <<else>><<He>> smooths it down before opening the book.<</if>>
      <</if>>
      <<if C.npc.Kylar.love gte 50>>"We could— we could look at it together," <<he>> says, retrieving the pencil.<<else>>You ask whether you can compare notes. <<He>> nods.<</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你在凯拉尔身边坐下，拿出课本。
      <<if C.npc.Kylar.love gte 50>><<He>>急忙把东西往旁边挪，一支铅笔滚落下去。<<else>><<He>>看看你的课本，把自己的东西挪开一点。<</if>>
      <<if $KylarExpansion.notes_repaired>>
        你誊好的那页纸夹在<<his>>的课本里。
        <<if $KylarExpansion.notes_day lt Time.days>>
          “这页没人乱写。”<<he>>轻声说着，把纸抚平。
          <<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>>“我没让他们碰。”你翻页时，<<his>>一根手指还按在纸边。<</if>>
        <<else>><<He>>把纸抚平，才翻开课本。<</if>>
      <</if>>
      <<if C.npc.Kylar.love gte 50>>“可以、可以一起看。”<<he>>捡起铅笔，小声说。<<else>>你问能不能对照一下笔记。<<He>>点了点头。<</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<englishicon>><<lanLink ['Compare your English notes (0:10)', '对照语文课的笔记 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Kylar School'>><<deadwood-kylar-school-study 'notes'>><</lanLink>><<genglish>><<glove>><br>
  <<englishicon>><<lanLink ['Play a word game (0:10)', '玩一会儿拼词游戏 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Kylar School'>><<deadwood-kylar-school-study 'words'>><</lanLink>><<lstress>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Kylar has put <<his>> books away. It is time to go.' '凯拉尔已经收起课本。该走了。'>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>>
<<if _area is 'library' and Time.schoolDay and (Time.hour is 12 or (Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 17))>>
  <<lanLink ['Put away your book', '收起课本'] 'Kylar Library'>><</lanLink>>
<<elseif _area is 'rear_courtyard' and Time.schoolDay and (Time.hour is 12 or (Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 17))>>
  <<lanLink ['Put away your book', '收起课本'] 'Kylar Courtyard'>><</lanLink>>
<<elseif _area is 'library'>>
  <<lanLink ['Return to the library', '返回图书馆'] 'School Library'>><</lanLink>>
<<else>>
  <<lanLink ['Return to the courtyard', '返回后院'] 'School Rear Courtyard'>><</lanLink>>
<</if>>
